WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 19]

01:39.280 --> 01:41.130
So this is a pharmacy too?

01:42.150 --> 01:44.210
Which master is in charge here?

01:45.070 --> 01:45.660
Me.

01:46.120 --> 01:46.540
Who is she?

01:50.200 --> 01:50.770
You?

01:53.040 --> 01:54.390
Young lady,

01:54.400 --> 01:56.100
get inside and help your master grind the herbs.

01:56.310 --> 01:57.290
Stop making trouble out here.

02:01.230 --> 02:02.540
May I ask, sir,

02:02.920 --> 02:04.180
if your Fengmen point aches faintly

02:04.870 --> 02:06.740
around 3 to 5 a.m. each day?

02:08.520 --> 02:09.220
How did you know?

02:09.960 --> 02:11.570
It must be from hard labor

02:11.680 --> 02:12.690
when I was young,

02:13.030 --> 02:14.060
so now I suffer.

02:14.430 --> 02:15.220
That makes sense.

02:15.470 --> 02:16.610
Then why does your Baihui point

02:17.000 --> 02:18.170
throb without stopping

02:18.470 --> 02:19.780
from 9 to 11 p.m.?

02:20.470 --> 02:21.820
You did farm work back then,

02:21.910 --> 02:22.610
but surely

02:22.960 --> 02:24.260
you didn't damage your head doing it.

02:25.280 --> 02:25.610
Hey...

02:25.840 --> 02:27.130
If you leave this untreated,

02:27.360 --> 02:28.010
I'm afraid

02:28.120 --> 02:29.380
you'll be meeting the King of Hell.

02:29.910 --> 02:30.690
Every word is spot-on!

02:31.280 --> 02:31.890
Spot-on!

02:32.310 --> 02:33.260
This physician is amazing!

02:33.260 --> 02:34.170
You're a real miracle physician!

02:35.400 --> 02:36.340
I've sought help for years,

02:36.470 --> 02:37.450
spent so much time and effort,

02:37.800 --> 02:38.610
all to cure

02:38.630 --> 02:39.660
this body of mine.

02:39.960 --> 02:40.450
But,

02:40.630 --> 02:41.820
though I've had plenty of prescriptions,

02:42.240 --> 02:43.340
nothing has helped.

02:43.910 --> 02:44.730
Miracle physician, save me!

02:45.080 --> 02:46.340
Please, save me!

02:47.030 --> 02:48.450
You said you did manual work

02:48.630 --> 02:49.450
when you were young.

02:49.750 --> 02:50.820
After that,

02:51.030 --> 02:51.890
did you rinse off?

02:52.590 --> 02:53.450
Of course.

02:54.130 --> 02:55.330
The well water there

02:55.400 --> 02:56.340
is ice-cool.

02:56.750 --> 02:57.690
After the heavy work,

02:57.870 --> 02:58.890
I'd pour it over my head.

02:59.680 --> 03:01.060
That felt great.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.450
There it is.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.290
Hot and cold colliding,

03:04.560 --> 03:05.820
yin and yang clashing.

03:06.310 --> 03:07.380
It's not an external illness,

03:07.520 --> 03:08.500
but you hurt your insides.

03:09.000 --> 03:10.500
I'll write you a prescription.

03:10.630 --> 03:11.500
When you get home,

03:11.960 --> 03:13.410
take it for forty-nine days,

03:13.710 --> 03:15.500
and you'll be cured.

03:16.430 --> 03:17.130
Thank you, miracle physician!

03:17.470 --> 03:18.340
Thank you so much!

03:19.360 --> 03:20.450
You're our clinic's

03:20.560 --> 03:21.820
first customer

03:21.910 --> 03:22.820
since we officially opened.

03:23.150 --> 03:24.850
I won't charge you.

03:27.080 --> 03:28.780
Thank you!

03:29.750 --> 03:30.170
Much obliged!

03:30.430 --> 03:31.570
Lady miracle physician,

03:31.840 --> 03:32.890
what do you treat?

03:34.430 --> 03:35.290
Sprains and fractures,

03:35.680 --> 03:36.450
hard cases too.

03:37.400 --> 03:37.940
In a word,

03:38.910 --> 03:39.610
if you're not dead,

03:40.240 --> 03:40.890
she can save you.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.410
Then I want a consultation.

03:42.590 --> 03:43.540
I'll be second.

03:44.000 --> 03:45.820
Can you charge me less?

03:46.870 --> 03:47.570
No consult fee.

03:48.000 --> 03:48.850
Half off the medicine.

03:52.250 --> 03:53.700
- Thanks, sir! - So kind!

03:53.700 --> 03:54.570
Thank you, miracle physician!

03:55.470 --> 03:56.820
Anyone seen today

03:57.470 --> 03:58.450
pays no consult fee,

03:59.080 --> 04:00.410
only half the herb cost.

04:01.520 --> 04:02.060
Please come in!

04:03.430 --> 04:04.100
What a good deed!

04:07.470 --> 04:08.780
You're bleeding money...

04:09.910 --> 04:10.660
Don't push.

04:10.840 --> 04:11.290
Form a line.

04:11.630 --> 04:12.890
What a true healer of the people!

04:14.750 --> 04:15.220
Uncle Zhe.

04:16.310 --> 04:16.900
Why the blank stare?

04:18.480 --> 04:19.340
Back in my day,

04:19.390 --> 04:20.780
I was a feared assassin.

04:21.830 --> 04:22.930
How'd I end up

04:23.070 --> 04:24.220
just lighting firecrackers?

04:26.040 --> 04:26.780
So what do you want to do?

04:28.120 --> 04:28.700
At least...

04:30.070 --> 04:31.410
let me unveil the red cloth.

04:33.480 --> 04:34.100
Uncle Zhe,

04:34.950 --> 04:35.900
that idea

04:36.190 --> 04:37.290
is a bit silly.

04:39.380 --> 04:42.100
[He-Yu Clinic]

04:43.310 --> 04:44.250
So many dishes.

04:44.480 --> 04:46.140
What a spread today!

04:48.120 --> 04:49.580
Well earned after a long day.

04:51.360 --> 04:51.700
Hold on!

04:52.950 --> 04:53.610
Physician Bai,

04:54.720 --> 04:56.140
on a day this good,

04:56.420 --> 04:57.180
say a few words.

04:59.430 --> 05:00.050
All right then.

05:00.720 --> 05:01.490
Here's to us:

05:02.070 --> 05:04.220
may this day come every year,

05:04.680 --> 05:06.810
with peace and health,

05:07.160 --> 05:09.250
friends, feast, and drink!

05:09.870 --> 05:10.540
Let's live

05:11.120 --> 05:13.280
as happy, carefree wanderers!

05:14.600 --> 05:15.230
Nice.

05:15.510 --> 05:16.220
I like that.

05:16.560 --> 05:17.280
No idea

05:17.280 --> 05:18.460
if your words will come true,

05:18.750 --> 05:19.540
but I'm downing

05:19.920 --> 05:20.460
this drink first!

05:21.480 --> 05:21.900
Cheers!

05:22.600 --> 05:22.930
Cheers!

05:23.680 --> 05:24.100
Cheers!

05:28.750 --> 05:29.250
Come in!

05:32.600 --> 05:33.140
Oh, you're having a meal?

05:38.480 --> 05:39.780
Didn't you already

05:39.800 --> 05:40.580
get your medicine today?

05:40.630 --> 05:41.490
Why are you back?

05:43.160 --> 05:43.930
They're here for me.

05:48.070 --> 05:48.980
Good work today.

05:49.430 --> 05:50.610
If we need it again,

05:50.800 --> 05:51.460
I'll call you.

05:52.680 --> 05:53.460
Not at all.

05:54.040 --> 05:54.610
Happy to help.

05:55.680 --> 05:56.540
That said,

05:56.870 --> 05:58.460
the physician's got real skill.

05:59.430 --> 06:01.220
I was hired to act,

06:01.390 --> 06:01.900
but

06:02.160 --> 06:03.000
she truly cured

06:03.000 --> 06:04.170
what I had.

06:05.870 --> 06:06.780
Forty-nine days,

06:07.070 --> 06:07.850
not a day less.

06:08.360 --> 06:08.730
I will!

06:08.950 --> 06:09.460
I will!

06:14.480 --> 06:15.580
- Thanks! - You saw through it already?

06:15.590 --> 06:16.210
Thanks...

06:17.190 --> 06:17.900
Not exactly.

06:18.540 --> 06:19.800
He said he had a trick.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.540
I didn't expect

06:21.630 --> 06:22.930
this kind of trick.

06:23.720 --> 06:24.170
Looks like

06:24.240 --> 06:25.660
my father was right:

06:26.920 --> 06:27.540
Su Changhe

06:27.870 --> 06:28.780
is rotten to the core.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.020
We'll take our leave.

06:30.930 --> 06:31.600
Farewell.

06:31.600 --> 06:32.190
Let's go.

06:32.190 --> 06:32.700
Thanks!

06:33.630 --> 06:33.930
See?

06:35.920 --> 06:36.730
After today,

06:37.060 --> 06:38.290
our He-Yu Clinic

06:38.510 --> 06:40.220
will be known across Nan'an City

06:40.630 --> 06:42.490
by everyone.

06:43.720 --> 06:45.490
Some patients today were plants,

06:46.040 --> 06:47.540
but tomorrow the real ones

06:47.920 --> 06:50.370
will flood our door.

06:53.560 --> 06:54.850
If it's just you two,

06:55.480 --> 06:56.580
this clinic of ours

06:56.720 --> 06:58.050
might shut in a day.

06:58.680 --> 07:00.780
So you still need me!

07:26.000 --> 07:26.340
Muyu.

07:26.600 --> 07:27.020
Give it a cut.

07:27.070 --> 07:27.810
Split this melon!

07:32.310 --> 07:32.810
Not bad!

07:33.270 --> 07:35.140
Straighter than Changhe's slices.

07:35.480 --> 07:36.780
Muyu, you're a sword deity!

07:38.950 --> 07:40.810
Our swords are so different in length.

07:41.070 --> 07:41.900
How's that comparable?

07:44.310 --> 07:45.170
Would a sword deity

07:45.800 --> 07:46.850
use his blade to slice watermelon?

07:52.310 --> 07:53.410
I'll go cook for you.

07:56.680 --> 07:57.370
Su Muyu.

08:01.480 --> 08:01.980
Miracle physician,

08:02.870 --> 08:03.660
I've made a decision.

08:04.430 --> 08:05.170
I'm taking a long trip.

08:10.390 --> 08:11.220
Some things

08:11.680 --> 08:12.890
need to be settled.

08:14.040 --> 08:14.610
If not,

08:15.160 --> 08:16.700
they'll be a knot in the heart.

08:17.510 --> 08:18.730
Even if

08:19.270 --> 08:20.340
you're happy

08:20.680 --> 08:21.250
most days,

08:22.430 --> 08:23.540
once you think of that hurdle,

08:24.630 --> 08:25.900
your smile just vanishes.

08:30.430 --> 08:30.930
Go!

08:32.120 --> 08:32.730
As long as

08:33.080 --> 08:34.460
you don't risk your life,

08:35.000 --> 08:35.580
it's fine.

08:37.270 --> 08:37.850
Thank you.

08:39.150 --> 08:40.250
Since I've learned the hidden past,

08:41.630 --> 08:43.300
I should do something for my family.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.850
Yours isn't a killer's sword.

08:50.320 --> 08:51.460
It's a sword that seeks justice.

08:53.030 --> 08:54.100
Think it through.

08:55.550 --> 08:57.220
From now on, be a swordsman,

08:57.630 --> 08:58.820
not a killer.

08:59.670 --> 09:00.180
At least...

09:01.790 --> 09:02.890
for the time being,

09:04.510 --> 09:05.580
I want a new role

09:06.910 --> 09:07.610
to seek an answer.

09:09.480 --> 09:10.060
What role?

09:10.870 --> 09:11.530
Young master

09:12.480 --> 09:13.300
of No-Sword City.

09:15.080 --> 09:16.250
And what answer?

09:17.390 --> 09:18.700
Wushuang City is peerless under heaven.

09:19.550 --> 09:20.980
But in the Way of the Sword,

09:21.750 --> 09:22.940
it can't claim "peerless"

09:24.000 --> 09:24.940
before No-Sword City.

09:27.270 --> 09:27.980
I see.

09:28.750 --> 09:29.650
You want to...

09:31.630 --> 09:32.250
challenge

09:33.390 --> 09:34.180
Wushuang City!

09:48.380 --> 09:49.670
[Song Yanhui of Wushuang City]

09:49.670 --> 09:50.250
Yushu.

09:51.320 --> 09:52.490
Are seeds really that tasty?

09:53.720 --> 09:54.340
Master,

09:54.790 --> 09:56.580
is sword practice that fun?

09:59.510 --> 10:00.890
Sword practice isn't fun.

10:01.630 --> 10:03.340
But I've trained since I was little.

10:04.120 --> 10:05.120
If one day

10:05.120 --> 10:06.180
I'm not allowed to train,

10:08.360 --> 10:09.130
I'll feel

10:09.150 --> 10:10.340
life has no meaning.

10:12.390 --> 10:12.980
Master,

10:14.030 --> 10:15.580
when will you start teaching me?

10:17.360 --> 10:18.250
You're dropping the seeds?

10:22.670 --> 10:23.300
No rush.

10:24.000 --> 10:25.010
You're born gifted.

10:25.670 --> 10:26.580
Every bit of carving

10:27.360 --> 10:28.250
is critical.

10:32.910 --> 10:34.650
My master once told me,

10:35.480 --> 10:36.490
I was born for the sword.

10:37.910 --> 10:39.340
I've trained hard for decades,

10:40.390 --> 10:41.010
yet...

10:42.910 --> 10:44.650
Li Hanyi, who came after me,

10:45.240 --> 10:46.820
has become the Xueyue Sword Deity,

10:48.080 --> 10:49.300
while I'm still stuck.

10:50.390 --> 10:51.650
I'm running out of time.

10:52.240 --> 10:52.820
Master,

10:53.790 --> 10:55.490
you come to the lake every day

10:56.270 --> 10:57.460
but do nothing.

10:58.440 --> 10:59.220
Is there

10:59.600 --> 11:00.980
some treasure in the lake?

11:01.720 --> 11:02.250
Yes.

11:12.750 --> 11:13.300
Master,

11:14.030 --> 11:14.580
what's this?

11:15.550 --> 11:16.890
This is the most precious treasure

11:17.030 --> 11:18.060
of our Wushuang City,

11:19.440 --> 11:20.340
the Peerless Sword Coffer.

11:21.390 --> 11:22.100
Inside this case

11:22.200 --> 11:23.220
are thirteen famed swords.

11:24.440 --> 11:26.700
One is called Daming Vermilion Bird.

11:27.240 --> 11:28.300
In the Register of Famous Swords,

11:28.750 --> 11:29.460
it ranks second.

11:30.240 --> 11:31.180
If it's "peerless",

11:31.630 --> 11:32.610
why isn't it first?

11:33.270 --> 11:35.300
First is the Emperor's sword.

11:36.120 --> 11:37.890
Daming Vermilion Bird is the martial world's sword,

11:38.910 --> 11:40.130
so it dares to claim "peerless".

12:07.870 --> 12:08.420
Master.

12:14.150 --> 12:14.770
Master,

12:15.440 --> 12:16.300
where's the sword?

12:18.320 --> 12:19.180
So it is.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.460
I've trained for thirty years.

12:23.510 --> 12:24.100
Today,

12:25.030 --> 12:27.010
I tried opening it for the first time.

12:28.390 --> 12:29.460
But in the end,

12:29.510 --> 12:30.420
I wasn't the one it chose.

12:32.320 --> 12:33.290
Heaven wills it.

12:34.240 --> 12:35.100
Can't we

12:35.360 --> 12:36.420
just open the coffer?

12:37.360 --> 12:38.220
The coffer has a spirit.

12:40.080 --> 12:41.670
Only when it meets the one it accepts

12:42.630 --> 12:43.850
will it open and yield a blade.

12:46.670 --> 12:47.530
Let me try.

12:53.360 --> 12:54.420
But you've never trained with a sword.

12:55.670 --> 12:56.850
Precisely because I haven't.

12:57.720 --> 12:59.010
Maybe this coffer

12:59.600 --> 13:01.340
likes a blank slate.

13:03.270 --> 13:03.700
All right.

13:30.320 --> 13:30.890
Master,

13:31.720 --> 13:32.340
this sword...

13:33.360 --> 13:34.130
is so beautiful!

13:35.030 --> 13:36.340
This is the Peerless Coffer's

13:37.600 --> 13:39.220
fabled Jade Ruyi.

13:39.870 --> 13:40.460
Master,

13:41.510 --> 13:42.220
just now, the coffer

13:42.600 --> 13:43.700
really opened for me!

13:53.600 --> 13:54.010
Yushu.

13:54.440 --> 13:54.850
Yushu!

14:06.910 --> 14:08.420
Seems at the end,

14:08.420 --> 14:09.320
[Liu Yunqi of Wushuang City]

14:09.320 --> 14:10.130
Wushuang City

14:11.120 --> 14:13.340
can still be peerless.

14:38.150 --> 14:38.650
Master.

14:39.270 --> 14:39.770
Master.

14:41.030 --> 14:42.410
Did the coffer open earlier?

14:45.360 --> 14:46.690
Was it me who opened it?

14:49.000 --> 14:50.370
Let me tell you a story.

14:51.790 --> 14:52.250
Come.

14:55.550 --> 14:57.100
When I was young,

14:57.550 --> 14:58.490
I once loosed a sword strike.

14:59.320 --> 14:59.850
That stroke

15:00.510 --> 15:01.580
pierced the clouds

15:02.360 --> 15:03.490
and burned red like dusk.

15:04.960 --> 15:07.250
Even the southbound swallows

15:07.440 --> 15:08.770
turned to look back.

15:11.030 --> 15:11.770
After that,

15:11.960 --> 15:12.610
my master

15:12.750 --> 15:13.820
changed my name

15:14.790 --> 15:15.850
to Song Yanhui.

15:18.120 --> 15:18.890
Today,

15:19.240 --> 15:20.730
I'll give you a new name too, okay?

15:22.000 --> 15:22.700
Master.

15:23.150 --> 15:24.420
What will you name me?

15:25.910 --> 15:26.610
From now on,

15:27.840 --> 15:28.730
you'll be called Wushuang.

15:29.550 --> 15:30.130
Wushuang?

15:31.480 --> 15:32.370
What about my surname?

15:32.600 --> 15:33.340
No need for one.

15:33.840 --> 15:34.850
Just Wushuang.

15:36.840 --> 15:39.420
Hereafter when people think of the Peerless Coffer,

15:39.870 --> 15:40.770
and speak of Wushuang City,

15:41.610 --> 15:42.650
it will be because of you.

15:43.270 --> 15:43.850
Because

15:44.360 --> 15:45.250
you are Wushuang.

15:47.630 --> 15:48.370
I believe in you.

15:49.790 --> 15:50.850
You will achieve

15:52.200 --> 15:53.340
what I could not.

15:54.010 --> 15:54.650
All right.

15:54.870 --> 15:55.370
Master.

15:55.790 --> 15:56.820
I'll be Wushuang from now on!

15:57.240 --> 15:57.700
Good.

16:01.550 --> 16:02.770
I won't be gone long.

16:03.670 --> 16:04.580
I'll be back soon.

16:05.790 --> 16:07.250
You made so much food.

16:08.630 --> 16:09.730
I really can't take it on the road.

16:12.270 --> 16:14.180
Then leave the pastries

16:14.320 --> 16:15.060
to me.

16:15.360 --> 16:16.180
I'll take care of them.

16:20.720 --> 16:22.130
I'd go with you,

16:22.550 --> 16:23.220
but,

16:23.390 --> 16:24.370
since you want to play

16:24.440 --> 16:25.340
No-Sword City's young master for a while,

16:25.910 --> 16:27.530
my identity at your side

16:28.720 --> 16:29.610
would spoil the scene.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.180
If he can't carry,

16:31.480 --> 16:32.370
I'll handle.

16:32.910 --> 16:33.940
Like you'd get the chance!

16:44.200 --> 16:44.940
What's this?

16:59.480 --> 17:00.590
I sent people to fetch it

17:00.590 --> 17:01.990
from Villa of Famed Swords.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.660
If you're challenging Wushuang City,

17:04.920 --> 17:06.250
you'll need a fine blade.

17:07.160 --> 17:08.090
She's right.

17:08.680 --> 17:09.900
To keep your cover,

17:10.200 --> 17:11.420
you can't use your umbrella sword,

17:12.070 --> 17:13.090
nor a cheap iron one

17:13.240 --> 17:14.900
you can buy anywhere.

17:17.550 --> 17:19.620
This blade is called Crane Feather.

17:20.440 --> 17:21.330
Crane as in white crane.

17:21.720 --> 17:22.460
Feather as in plume.

17:24.160 --> 17:26.140
Win at Wushuang City with it,

17:26.790 --> 17:27.620
and your name will spread.

17:28.400 --> 17:29.090
Consider it

17:29.480 --> 17:30.900
as also making a name for me.

17:44.310 --> 17:45.010
This must be pricey, right?

17:45.790 --> 17:46.620
You bet.

17:47.310 --> 17:48.620
It cost our clinic

17:48.830 --> 17:50.050
three months' earnings.

17:53.550 --> 17:54.490
This pricey gift

17:55.550 --> 17:56.620
truly says a lot about your feelings.

18:05.830 --> 18:06.490
Not bad.

18:06.830 --> 18:08.290
I've got great taste.

18:09.510 --> 18:10.140
A fine sword

18:10.830 --> 18:11.420
and a beauty,

18:12.110 --> 18:12.940
what a pair!

18:18.790 --> 18:19.090
Besides,

18:19.290 --> 18:20.290
one more item for you.

18:29.510 --> 18:30.180
What's this?

18:31.160 --> 18:32.940
It's my little pet.

18:33.110 --> 18:34.050
Lend it to you for protection.

18:36.440 --> 18:37.940
Take good care of it.

18:39.510 --> 18:39.940
All right.

18:41.070 --> 18:41.940
I won't let you down.

18:44.640 --> 18:45.660
Looking at you now,

18:45.880 --> 18:48.420
you do seem a roaming hero!

18:50.350 --> 18:51.090
Maybe

18:51.790 --> 18:53.420
he was meant to be one.

18:55.680 --> 18:56.660
He's leaving.

18:57.240 --> 18:58.290
So shouldn't you

18:58.480 --> 18:59.140
head home too?

19:00.590 --> 19:01.980
You're kicking me out already?

19:04.240 --> 19:04.980
Well, it can't be helped.

19:05.110 --> 19:05.940
I do need to go.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.290
Those so-called "family" back in Blood River

19:08.590 --> 19:09.490
are nothing compared to you.

19:10.550 --> 19:11.660
They're not reliable at all.

19:13.350 --> 19:13.900
Enough talk.

19:14.310 --> 19:15.810
While everyone's still here,

19:16.070 --> 19:17.010
let's polish off these pastries

19:17.270 --> 19:17.980
together.

19:18.590 --> 19:19.530
You can't finish them anyway.

19:36.070 --> 19:37.290
Stake more!

19:37.550 --> 19:38.010
Rest easy.

19:38.550 --> 19:39.700
You'll all come out ahead.

19:41.740 --> 19:44.780
[Tianxia House]

19:48.080 --> 19:48.770
Sir,

19:48.950 --> 19:49.660
right this way.

19:50.110 --> 19:51.110
Boy, take the horse.

19:51.160 --> 19:51.570
Coming!

19:53.240 --> 19:54.220
This way, honored guest.

19:55.440 --> 19:56.570
Our Tianxia House

19:56.790 --> 19:58.000
can't match the fame

19:58.000 --> 20:00.010
of Thousand-Gold Tower in Tianqi City,

20:00.110 --> 20:01.810
Beauty Manor in Sangu City,

20:01.920 --> 20:04.590
or Xiaoyao City of Qingzhou's Hundred Cities.

20:04.680 --> 20:06.770
We rank last of the Four Great Casinos.

20:07.000 --> 20:07.670
Besides,

20:07.720 --> 20:09.700
unlike the other three

20:09.770 --> 20:10.860
that serve

20:10.970 --> 20:12.770
nobles and merchants,

20:13.270 --> 20:14.220
our Tianxia House

20:14.640 --> 20:16.220
mostly hosts

20:16.680 --> 20:17.620
folk of the martial world.

20:17.830 --> 20:19.810
That's the biggest difference.

20:20.510 --> 20:21.140
Because

20:21.350 --> 20:23.330
behind Tianxia House

20:23.790 --> 20:24.810
stands

20:25.240 --> 20:27.290
the famed city of arms,

20:27.680 --> 20:30.090
the peerless Wushuang City.

20:33.270 --> 20:34.140
Wushuang City...

20:34.920 --> 20:37.380
You wish to reach Wushuang City?

20:37.960 --> 20:38.380
Yes.

20:39.680 --> 20:40.770
But to enter,

20:41.590 --> 20:42.700
you need a Wushuang Token.

20:42.920 --> 20:43.620
Right.

20:44.200 --> 20:46.180
Ten li from here,

20:46.270 --> 20:47.380
there's only one road

20:47.750 --> 20:49.730
with a dozen checkpoints.

20:50.110 --> 20:51.900
Each one checks your token

20:52.160 --> 20:53.180
before you pass.

20:53.640 --> 20:54.420
But...

20:54.920 --> 20:57.770
that token's hard to get.

20:58.240 --> 20:59.090
A friend said

21:00.310 --> 21:01.570
there's a way here.

21:03.160 --> 21:04.490
Naturally.

21:05.640 --> 21:06.860
Name your price.

21:08.680 --> 21:10.250
This is Tianxia House.

21:10.880 --> 21:11.900
Nothing here

21:12.350 --> 21:13.220
is sold.

21:13.830 --> 21:14.860
Only...

21:17.110 --> 21:18.570
gambled.

21:18.960 --> 21:20.180
You need to wager

21:20.510 --> 21:22.090
something valuable you have.

21:22.480 --> 21:23.140
Win,

21:23.140 --> 21:25.180
you take the token.

21:25.830 --> 21:26.570
Lose,

21:27.000 --> 21:29.010
your stake stays behind.

21:32.200 --> 21:32.810
I'll bet.

21:33.070 --> 21:35.090
- Big! - Small!

21:35.630 --> 21:36.400
Very well!

21:37.880 --> 21:38.810
This way, sir.

21:45.550 --> 21:46.140
Here

21:46.790 --> 21:48.250
is your table.

21:49.240 --> 21:50.490
I'm no gambler.

21:51.240 --> 21:52.460
But since I'm here,

21:52.960 --> 21:54.140
I'll follow the house rules.

21:56.160 --> 21:57.290
I have a 1,000-tael note.

21:58.070 --> 21:58.980
Will that do?

22:02.000 --> 22:04.050
As I said,

22:04.640 --> 22:05.810
you must stake

22:06.110 --> 22:07.980
something precious.

22:08.110 --> 22:09.100
A banknote

22:09.200 --> 22:10.290
plainly isn't it.

22:11.720 --> 22:14.490
What we want is...

22:15.160 --> 22:16.050
that stuff.

22:21.070 --> 22:21.530
Sorry.

22:22.680 --> 22:23.490
This sword

22:23.510 --> 22:24.420
means a lot to me.

22:25.400 --> 22:26.420
I do have a Dragon's Tear Pearl.

22:27.830 --> 22:29.490
Would that count as rare?

22:30.680 --> 22:31.700
Dragon's Tear Pearl...

22:32.160 --> 22:32.810
It's said

22:33.000 --> 22:34.810
this bead holds great power.

22:35.310 --> 22:37.460
If one cultivates inner skill

22:37.720 --> 22:38.940
wearing it day and night,

22:39.790 --> 22:40.900
in half a year,

22:41.440 --> 22:42.860
his body will undergo

22:43.070 --> 22:44.810
marvelous changes.

22:45.160 --> 22:46.010
Good eye, sir.

22:46.790 --> 22:48.290
It is a fine piece.

22:48.750 --> 22:49.660
Worth the wager.

22:49.960 --> 22:50.980
How do you want to bet?

22:59.440 --> 23:00.660
Tianxia House rules:

23:01.240 --> 23:02.730
the guest decides.

23:03.830 --> 23:06.530
We offer table games and beast bouts.

23:07.270 --> 23:08.330
Which will you choose?

23:08.880 --> 23:09.530
Are table games

23:11.480 --> 23:13.090
the ones downstairs?

23:14.110 --> 23:14.910
Yes.

23:16.310 --> 23:18.620
Dominoes, Madiao Cards, Big/Small, and Cover-and-Guess.

23:19.680 --> 23:20.530
And beast bouts

23:20.640 --> 23:21.770
are our house's

23:21.790 --> 23:23.140
signature specialty:

23:23.830 --> 23:25.900
cockfights, dogfights, cricketfights,

23:26.440 --> 23:28.180
and horse, pigeon, and dog races.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.660
Take your pick.

23:30.350 --> 23:31.380
Do you offer spider fights?

23:51.000 --> 23:52.330
Eight-eyed wolf spiders.

23:55.030 --> 23:56.770
Well informed, sir.

23:57.510 --> 23:58.490
Then,

23:59.240 --> 24:00.900
which one will you back?

24:01.920 --> 24:03.420
Must I choose one from them?

24:04.880 --> 24:05.620
Unless

24:06.160 --> 24:07.530
there's another option.

24:15.000 --> 24:15.980
I have a spider too.

24:16.750 --> 24:19.050
I'll pit it against both.

24:20.030 --> 24:20.810
If it wins,

24:21.510 --> 24:22.290
I win.

24:23.070 --> 24:23.700
How about it?

24:25.960 --> 24:27.140
Eight-eyed wolf spider

24:27.350 --> 24:28.810
is no common spider.

24:29.590 --> 24:31.010
Your box

24:31.120 --> 24:32.770
is barely half the size

24:32.790 --> 24:33.940
of a wolf spider's.

24:34.790 --> 24:36.810
How can one beat two?

24:37.510 --> 24:38.180
Sir,

24:38.440 --> 24:40.290
aren't you overconfident?

24:41.960 --> 24:42.810
Then let's try.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.290
Settled.

25:08.380 --> 25:09.090
Hey, out.

25:12.880 --> 25:13.530
What's this?

25:17.590 --> 25:18.250
Go.

25:33.830 --> 25:34.220
Oh...

25:38.240 --> 25:40.090
This is a White-Ghost Spider!

25:40.880 --> 25:41.980
The very one of legend

25:42.000 --> 25:43.980
that can take on a hundred!

26:00.480 --> 26:01.380
Then I won

26:02.680 --> 26:03.810
the Wushuang Token, right?

26:07.030 --> 26:09.040
You carry a peerless sword,

26:09.110 --> 26:10.370
bear a Dragon's Tear Pearl,

26:10.550 --> 26:11.780
and casually produce

26:11.790 --> 26:13.350
a rare White-Ghost Spider.

26:13.400 --> 26:15.050
Your birth must be uncommon.

26:15.790 --> 26:16.980
With such standing,

26:17.270 --> 26:19.050
why come to my house

26:19.160 --> 26:20.720
for a Wushuang Token?

26:20.880 --> 26:21.660
What's your aim

26:22.000 --> 26:22.730
visiting here today?

26:32.510 --> 26:33.220
I won.

26:33.880 --> 26:34.900
Give me the token.

26:35.750 --> 26:37.660
I followed your rules,

26:38.640 --> 26:39.900
so please

26:41.000 --> 26:42.570
follow yours.

26:44.840 --> 26:45.860
Fine...

26:45.860 --> 26:47.530
I'll take you to it.

26:48.070 --> 26:48.770
Much obliged.

27:03.220 --> 27:05.220
[Lord Haoyue of Tianxia House]

27:07.440 --> 27:08.050
This way.

27:11.000 --> 27:11.730
Master.

27:17.110 --> 27:18.050
It's been ages

27:18.110 --> 27:19.330
since anyone came in here.

27:20.720 --> 27:21.810
I won at Tianxia House,

27:23.550 --> 27:24.660
so I should get the token.

27:26.110 --> 27:26.530
Yes.

27:28.440 --> 27:30.010
The token is already yours.

27:30.790 --> 27:31.620
But guests of your skill

27:31.640 --> 27:32.490
are rare indeed.

27:33.680 --> 27:34.490
Our house wishes

27:34.510 --> 27:35.940
to know you better.

27:36.960 --> 27:37.900
Do those behind the wall

27:39.480 --> 27:40.620
wish to know me too?

27:58.160 --> 27:59.490
As I expected,

28:00.350 --> 28:01.620
you were really

28:02.240 --> 28:03.220
extraordinary.

28:05.790 --> 28:06.490
As I said,

28:07.590 --> 28:08.380
the token

28:09.920 --> 28:11.180
is already yours.

28:15.350 --> 28:15.980
I'll take my leave.

28:16.960 --> 28:17.570
As you wish.

28:21.310 --> 28:22.010
Hero, wait!

28:22.400 --> 28:22.940
Please wait!

28:23.510 --> 28:24.250
Please wait!

28:27.240 --> 28:27.700
What is it?

28:28.480 --> 28:30.460
If someone stops you on the way,

28:30.960 --> 28:31.660
just say

28:32.030 --> 28:33.360
you ordered a Soul-Chasing Crossbow

28:33.400 --> 28:35.700
from Yuexia Smithy in Wushuang City,

28:36.070 --> 28:38.660
and you're here to pick it up.

28:39.790 --> 28:40.330
Got it.

29:06.070 --> 29:06.660
Poison on it.

29:13.720 --> 29:14.490
What do you mean?

29:15.960 --> 29:17.050
Planning a mutiny, are you?

29:19.160 --> 29:20.420
I'm your Patriarch.

29:24.400 --> 29:24.810
Careful.

29:25.030 --> 29:25.770
He isn't poisoned.

29:44.240 --> 29:45.330
What about Yumo and Changli?

29:46.440 --> 29:47.420
Those who back you

29:47.920 --> 29:48.620
have all been poisoned

29:49.920 --> 29:51.420
and are now confined.

29:53.200 --> 29:54.660
Su Luandan did this, didn't he?

29:58.000 --> 29:59.140
I really underestimated him.

30:07.160 --> 30:07.810
Eat your fill!

30:08.200 --> 30:08.530
Okay!

30:08.680 --> 30:10.380
In this heat, watermelon hits the spot!

30:12.720 --> 30:13.570
Come share some!

30:13.880 --> 30:14.570
But we have to...

30:15.310 --> 30:16.050
No one is coming.

30:16.440 --> 30:17.050
Get over here.

30:17.160 --> 30:17.620
Eat with us.

30:17.750 --> 30:18.010
Quick!

30:36.400 --> 30:37.250
Today, eat all you want.

30:37.640 --> 30:39.050
As much as you like, hear me?

30:39.880 --> 30:40.380
Get me another slice.

30:40.590 --> 30:41.090
So sweet.

30:43.310 --> 30:43.940
Misters.

30:47.030 --> 30:47.680
Misters!

30:48.160 --> 30:49.190
This melon's really sweet!

30:49.200 --> 30:49.660
Yeah.

30:50.510 --> 30:51.090
Sure is!

30:51.680 --> 30:52.460
This watermelon

30:52.590 --> 30:53.570
was brought all the way

30:53.590 --> 30:54.770
from Nan'an City.

30:55.400 --> 30:55.980
So,

30:56.240 --> 30:56.980
eat up.

31:00.790 --> 31:01.250
Halt!

31:04.880 --> 31:05.420
Who are you?

31:06.000 --> 31:07.660
Daring breach Wushuang City's checkpoint?

31:09.440 --> 31:09.860
Apologies.

31:11.790 --> 31:13.490
You looked too busy to notice me just now,

31:13.750 --> 31:14.660
so I took the liberty.

31:16.680 --> 31:17.420
I have a Wushuang Token.

31:18.720 --> 31:19.570
[Wushuang]
I'm here

31:19.590 --> 31:20.660
because I ordered a Soul-Chasing Crossbow

31:21.030 --> 31:22.460
from Yuexia Smithy in Wushuang City.

31:23.000 --> 31:24.050
I came to pick it up.

31:24.750 --> 31:25.420
Not right.

31:26.350 --> 31:27.090
What's not right?

31:27.720 --> 31:29.030
Show the token first,

31:29.240 --> 31:30.610
then step forward.

31:31.310 --> 31:32.010
As it stands,

31:32.070 --> 31:33.530
you passed three horse-lengths

31:33.530 --> 31:34.420
before showing the token.

31:34.750 --> 31:36.010
Out of order.

31:44.880 --> 31:45.490
My apologies.

31:46.480 --> 31:47.330
I'd like to pass now.

31:48.110 --> 31:48.620
May I?

31:55.510 --> 31:56.490
Can a dead man

31:57.000 --> 31:57.940
still stand up?

31:58.510 --> 31:59.590
Can a tree made into a boat

31:59.830 --> 32:00.770
be planted back?

32:01.550 --> 32:03.120
Can rice boiled to porridge

32:03.480 --> 32:04.460
turn back to fried rice?

32:04.590 --> 32:05.840
- No! - No!

32:05.840 --> 32:06.490
Exactly!

32:06.790 --> 32:07.840
No good!

32:09.270 --> 32:10.460
Then, mister,

32:11.480 --> 32:12.220
how should it be?

32:13.350 --> 32:14.620
These three horse-lengths,

32:15.030 --> 32:16.570
one thousand taels each.

32:17.110 --> 32:18.180
Three horse-lengths,

32:18.920 --> 32:19.620
that's three thousand total.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.420
You're joking.

32:24.830 --> 32:25.770
That Soul-Chasing Crossbow

32:26.350 --> 32:27.860
isn't worth three thousand taels.

32:28.920 --> 32:30.090
Even if I need it,

32:30.640 --> 32:31.250
I wouldn't make

32:31.310 --> 32:32.490
such a losing deal.

32:33.640 --> 32:35.290
Wushuang City's famous across the land.

32:36.030 --> 32:37.290
It's surely not short of three thousand taels.

32:38.400 --> 32:39.330
Wushuang City isn't,

32:39.880 --> 32:40.530
but I am!

32:41.680 --> 32:43.250
Besides, you're veiled,

32:43.480 --> 32:45.220
and won't even show your real face.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.460
How do I know

32:46.880 --> 32:49.050
what intent hides under that veil?

32:50.680 --> 32:51.140
Sorry.

32:52.480 --> 32:53.850
I've had a strange illness since childhood.

32:54.510 --> 32:56.250
My face can't be in sunlight,

32:57.270 --> 32:58.220
or it breaks out in red sores.

32:59.270 --> 33:00.460
So I travel veiled.

33:01.350 --> 33:02.140
Please understand.

33:04.480 --> 33:04.980
All right then.

33:05.640 --> 33:06.250
Out of pity,

33:06.920 --> 33:07.490
three hundred taels.

33:08.510 --> 33:09.980
Not a coin less!

33:16.550 --> 33:17.180
Hand it over!

33:18.200 --> 33:18.660
Move along.

33:19.270 --> 33:20.290
We've struck gold this time.

33:20.310 --> 33:21.710
- Sure have, look at that. - Come on.

33:21.710 --> 33:22.490
Split it with me.

33:26.240 --> 33:26.770
Wait!

33:36.640 --> 33:37.530
What now?

33:38.270 --> 33:39.900
You sighed just now.

33:40.960 --> 33:41.700
What was that about?

33:42.750 --> 33:43.840
I just felt sorry for you.

33:45.240 --> 33:47.250
Wushuang City, once No.1 under heaven,

33:48.590 --> 33:49.700
sets up all these checkpoints

33:50.680 --> 33:51.940
just to squeeze travelers.

33:52.790 --> 33:53.730
I've long admired

33:53.790 --> 33:54.770
Wushuang City's renown.

33:55.920 --> 33:56.660
But this experience today

33:58.240 --> 33:58.860
really disappointed me.

34:01.110 --> 34:02.010
"Once"?

34:02.550 --> 34:02.980
Kid,

34:03.640 --> 34:05.070
Wushuang City has always

34:05.070 --> 34:06.210
been the top power.

34:06.550 --> 34:07.900
Spouting nonsense here,

34:08.190 --> 34:09.200
you're not afraid to die?

34:10.840 --> 34:12.050
These days in the jianghu,

34:13.190 --> 34:14.980
No.1 is Xueyue City.

34:15.630 --> 34:16.780
That's not just

34:16.880 --> 34:17.740
my opinion.

34:18.550 --> 34:20.260
If you think Wushuang City is stronger,

34:21.440 --> 34:22.090
then tell me,

34:23.070 --> 34:24.740
who beat Ye Dingzhi by half a palm

34:25.480 --> 34:27.010
and saved the realm?

34:28.320 --> 34:29.740
Which of today's Five Sword Deities

34:30.920 --> 34:32.610
is named after a city?

34:33.150 --> 34:35.300
Who is the No.1 Spear Deity?

34:35.840 --> 34:37.130
None of them hail from Wushuang City.

34:38.110 --> 34:39.420
So why call Wushuang City No.1?

34:39.880 --> 34:40.570
You brat...

34:43.960 --> 34:44.460
Sitong,

34:45.670 --> 34:46.420
return his banknote.

34:46.800 --> 34:47.690
Senior...

34:47.880 --> 34:48.570
Return it!

34:48.800 --> 34:49.170
But...

34:50.960 --> 34:51.260
Here.

34:52.230 --> 34:52.860
Take it!

34:55.320 --> 34:55.980
You're right.

34:56.440 --> 34:58.100
Doing this is shameful.

34:58.550 --> 34:59.090
However,

34:59.920 --> 35:01.820
you insulted Wushuang City.

35:02.550 --> 35:03.980
I can't let it slide.

35:04.880 --> 35:06.460
Dare face me in a bout?

35:07.510 --> 35:08.820
From Tianxia House to here,

35:09.590 --> 35:11.130
Wushuang City has let me down.

35:12.190 --> 35:13.860
So much I'd rather leave now.

35:14.320 --> 35:15.740
Looks like without a lesson,

35:16.960 --> 35:18.490
you'll never learn!

35:37.110 --> 35:37.740
Heavenly Pass Spear!

35:38.030 --> 35:38.980
Senior, no!

35:39.360 --> 35:40.340
If someone dies here,

35:40.360 --> 35:40.780
we'll also...

35:47.500 --> 35:50.980
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:51.020 --> 35:54.900
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:56.740 --> 36:00.220
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:00.260 --> 36:04.100
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

36:06.100 --> 36:09.380
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

36:09.500 --> 36:11.580
♪Still I can't let go♪

36:11.740 --> 36:15.180
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

36:15.660 --> 36:17.860
♪My heart no longer my own♪

36:17.980 --> 36:22.980
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:39.580 --> 36:43.300
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:43.420 --> 36:47.500
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:48.740 --> 36:52.620
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:52.740 --> 36:56.980
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:58.100 --> 37:00.980
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

37:01.060 --> 37:05.300
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

37:07.580 --> 37:11.580
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

37:11.620 --> 37:15.060
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

37:16.580 --> 37:20.020
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:20.100 --> 37:23.900
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:25.820 --> 37:29.260
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

37:29.300 --> 37:33.140
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

37:35.180 --> 37:38.420
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

37:38.540 --> 37:40.620
♪Still I can't let go♪

37:40.820 --> 37:44.220
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

37:44.700 --> 37:46.900
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:46.980 --> 37:52.020
♪No one can escape from love♪

37:59.380 --> 38:01.580
♪My heart no longer my own♪

38:01.660 --> 38:06.700
♪No one can escape from love♪
